+// combined into one predicate and one branch into the slow path
+// (branchPostBarrierNeededIA64()), then the rejoin; the global check is out
+// of line.  (Testing only the value inline sent every store of a nursery
+// value into a nursery object out of line and back.)  Its slow path saves only the
+// volatile registers live at the barrier: the others, its temp, the
+// scratch and out registers, p6-p15, b0/b6/b7 and the FP scratch are its
+// clobber set.
+template <class LPostBarrierType, class OolType>
+bool CodeGenerator::emitPostWriteBarrierCrossableIA64(LPostBarrierType* lir,
+                                                 OolType* ool, Register value,
+                                                 bool boxed, Register index) {
