+  // handler each time (Crypto -40%, wiki/hw-memory.html); with the deferral it
+  // is a NaT nobody checks.  Stores never cross.  Also while the pipeliner records a loop:
+  // it records each instruction as emitted, before the window moves it, so
+  // only the plain copy's schedule changes (zlib +1%, DeltaBlue +1% with the
